    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Да, мы вместе.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, we are together.' Vika starts with 'we' and pairs it with 'together' to make the point clear.",
